de:
Für eine endliche Verschiebung $\delta$ gilt $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=e^{-iH\delta}\ket{\psi(t)}.$ Entwickelt man bis zur ersten Ordnung, $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=\left(\mathbf 1-i\delta H\right)\ket{\psi(t)}
+O(\delta^2).$ so ist $H$ der infinitesimale Erzeuger, der einen Zustand in der Zeit fortentwickelt.

zh-Hant:
對於有限的時間位移 $\delta$， $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=e^{-iH\delta}\ket{\psi(t)}.$ 展開至一階，得 $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=\left(\mathbf 1-i\delta H\right)\ket{\psi(t)}
+O(\delta^2).$ 因此，$H$ 是使態隨時間演化的無窮小生成元。

ko:
유한한 시간 변화 $\delta$에 대해 $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=e^{-iH\delta}\ket{\psi(t)}.$ 1차까지 전개하면 $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=\left(\mathbf 1-i\delta H\right)\ket{\psi(t)}
+O(\delta^2).$ 따라서 $H$는 시간에 따라 상태를 변화시키는 무한소 생성자다.

vi:
Đối với một độ dời hữu hạn $\delta$, $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=e^{-iH\delta}\ket{\psi(t)}.$ Khai triển đến bậc nhất, $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=\left(\mathbf 1-i\delta H\right)\ket{\psi(t)}
+O(\delta^2).$ Vì vậy $H$ là bộ sinh vô cùng bé làm tiến hóa một trạng thái theo thời gian.

ru:
Для конечного сдвига $\delta$, $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=e^{-iH\delta}\ket{\psi(t)}.$ Разлагая по первому порядку, $\ket{\psi(t+\delta)}
=\left(\mathbf 1-i\delta H\right)\ket{\psi(t)}
+O(\delta^2).$ Таким образом, $H$ — бесконечно малый генератор, сдвигающий состояние по времени.

p.src:
Internal symmetries such as isospin and color also change particle labels. Isospin can mix proton and neutron states; color rotations mix red, green, and blue quarks. Yet no composition of those internal transformations translates a system in space or time. Supersymmetry is different: $\begin{gathered}
\text{odd particle-changing transformation}\\
\mathrel{\stackrel{\{\ ,\ \}}{\Longrightarrow}}\\
\text{time translation}
\end{gathered}$ That is the clue that the odd generators may themselves be translations, but along coordinates unlike the usual ones.

